+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  Each row sells a positive whole number of dish portions at an ISO instant.
+  Previously imported tickets are skipped. The response is `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`;
+  dishes counts portions. A bad row or insufficient stock rejects the whole file.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+  `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }`, in item ID order. Days are UTC
+  and inclusive; difference is actual minus theoretical.
